    <comment>- Normalize version to @PARENT_TAG@+git@TAG_OFFSET@. The version is
  thus changed from 43.0.git.167 to 43.0+git167, which is
  interpreted the same way by RPM/zypper&quot;
  &gt; zypper vcmp 43.0.git.167 43.0+git167
    43.0.git.167 matches 43.0+git167</comment>
